      ],
      "foaf:homepage": "https://nccrdataplatform.ccdi.cancer.gov/data-browser/PHARM",
      "dct:description": "Information derived from outpatient pharmacy providers' claims for medications dispensed to patients with cancer. Includes patients with claims since 2000 from commercial plans, Medicaid, and commercial pharmacies. Contains 9- and 11-digit NDC codes, CanMED and RxNorm drug classification, dispense quantity and duration, and months from diagnosis to dispense. Not hospital-based: contains mostly outpatient pharmacy prescriptions, so while oral antineoplastics and infusion-based chemotherapies are included, hospital-based chemotherapy agents are not. Contains 13,017,829 records for 249,120 patients, covering diagnosis years 1995-2023.",
      "dct:language": "en",
      "dct:rights": [
        "Controlled access. Individual-level de-identified data requires IRB review and approval via the NCCR Data Access Request process."
      ],
