      "dct:title": "NCCR Radiation Oncology (RO)",
      "dct:alternative": [
        "RO"
      ],
      "foaf:homepage": "https://nccrdataplatform.ccdi.cancer.gov/data-browser/RO",
      "dct:description": "Data from NCI-supported Cancer Centers and the Pediatric Proton/Photon Consortium Registry (PPCR). Offers expanded radiation treatment data associated with each patient's course of therapy providing an enhanced longitudinal perspective regarding exposure to radiotherapy. Includes radiation anatomic site, radiation therapy type, radiation energy type, total and prescribed doses and fractions, months from index diagnosis to start and end of radiation therapy event, and other elements abstracted from clinical records. Covers patients with a SEER diagnosis year of 1995-2023 and radiation therapy events that took place between 1995 and 2023. Contains 5,060 records for 2,650 patients.",
